abstract: >
  Reproducibility repository for a locus-resolved integrative analysis of
  validated regulatory elements in the mouse Gli3 region. The repository
  contains figure- and table-level processed outputs, provenance information,
  build-aware genomic resources, scripts, and manuscript-ready assets.
  Functional validation is treated as the anchor for enhancer identity,
  whereas chromatin, transcription-factor, and chromosome-contact datasets are
  interpreted as correlative genomic context. The September 2026 revision
  includes an integrated 54-enhancer signal analysis and a locus-matched
  comparison of validated limb and non-limb enhancers.
